{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21972","headline":"谕友 · 白居易","name":"谕友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜霜一降，杀君庭中槐。\n乾叶不待黄，索索飞下来。\n怜君感节物，晨起步前阶。\n临风蹋叶立，半日颜色哀。\n西望长安城，歌钟十二街。\n何人不欢乐，君独心悠哉。\n白日头上走，朱颜镜中颓。\n平生青云心，销化成死灰。\n我今赠一言，胜饮酒千杯。\n其言虽甚鄙，可破悒悒怀。\n朱门有勳贵，陋巷有颜回。\n穷通各问命，不系才不才。\n推此自豁豁，不必待安排。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}